WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.485
Wendy was a happy girl, but she didn't have a hobby.

2
00:00:04.486 --> 00:00:08.957
All her friends had hobbies, but she didn't have one.

3
00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:12.542
Her friend Julie liked to play the violin.

4
00:00:12.543 --> 00:00:16.815
Her friend Michelle liked to collect dolls.

5
00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:23.897
But Wendy didn't play any instruments and her room wasn't big enough to collect anything.

6
00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:27.615
One day Wendy was with her grandma.

7
00:00:27.616 --> 00:00:30.056
She asked her grandma.

8
00:00:30.057 --> 00:00:33.317
"Grandma, what's your hobby?"

9
00:00:33.318 --> 00:00:37.534
Wendy's grandma smiled a great big smile.

10
00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:43.189
"You know, for many years, I didn't think I had a hobby.

11
00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:48.024
All my friends had hobbies, but I didn't have one.

12
00:00:48.025 --> 00:00:51.875
One of my friends liked to play the piano.

13
00:00:51.876 --> 00:00:56.199
One of my friends liked to collect postcards.

14
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.395
But I didn't play any instruments and I didn't have a room big enough to collect anything.

15
00:01:04.396 --> 00:01:10.014
"But then, one day, I asked my grandmother what she collected.

16
00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:14.444
And she told me she was a dream collector.

17
00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:20.665
Dreams don't take up any space, so you will always have enough room.

18
00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:24.788
Dreams don't require any special skills.

19
00:01:24.789 --> 00:01:27.397
Dreams can't be stolen.

20
00:01:27.398 --> 00:01:30.246
And dreams can last forever.

21
00:01:30.247 --> 00:01:34.925
My grandma had many dreams in her collection."

22
00:01:34.926 --> 00:01:37.078
Wendy thought for a moment.

23
00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:39.428
She was a good dreamer.

24
00:01:39.429 --> 00:01:43.373
She already had many dreams in her collection.

25
00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:49.321
And then she understood; she had always been a dream collector.

26
00:01:49.322 --> 00:01:52.565
She looked at her grandma and smiled.

27
00:01:52.566 --> 00:02:00.932
"Grandma, I'm a dream collector, too."

